<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>details such as roman-numbering, table-of-contents =
entry, etc.\ could be</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>dealt with in the style file (as questions of \lq\lq =
design'') without the</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>author being involved.&nbsp; Although the author =
would have to learn a bit</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>of publishing jargon (\lq\lq front matter'', etc.), =
this might at least</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>help him/her to understand the language used in books =
about typesetting</FONT>

