need to learn about the</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>the \verb+\chapter*+, \verb+\addcontentsline+ and =
\verb+\pagenumbering+</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>commands.&nbsp; (The \verb+\chapter*+ and =
\verb+\addcontentsline+ commands might</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>appear in style files, where there could be a =
