<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; immediately below, to =
hold the notes.</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>\item there was some means whereby the user could =
tell \LaTeX\ to base</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; it's decision about =
{\tt tabular}-width on the rows that hold</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; the table-proper but =
could let the {\tt tabular} continue below the</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; table-proper. Notes =
could then be provided in ``extra rows'' that</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; had the same width as =
the table-proper.</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>\end{itemize}</FONT>
</P>

<P><FONT SIZE=3D2>It would be even better if the user specified the =
