<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; where its length will =
be a problem</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>\item give the user an authoring problem ``How can I =
improve this</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; stopgap list-of-tables =
